  "details": "The module provides a permission that allows users to configure email templates containing Twig code. This permission was not marked as restricted.\n\nA site administrator might inadvertently grant this permission to less-trusted users. This would allow those users to execute Twig within email templates, and to gain access to functionality and information intended only for highly trusted administrators.",
